OL,4,CSeafront wheel lease jeopardises i360, 
OL,5,Cowner says                             
OL,6,GThe owner of the Brighton i360 says    
OL,7,Gshe is "really worried about the       
OL,8,Gfuture" of the attraction after a      
OL,9,Glease was granted for a seafront       
OL,10,Gferris wheel to return.                
OL,12,FSarah Willingham, who bought the       
OL,13,Fviewing tower in 2024 after it went    
OL,14,Finto administration, says Brighton and 
OL,15,FHove City Council have "put the future 
OL,16,Fof the i360 in jeopardy" by granting a 
OL,17,F25-year lease for the Brighton Wheel   
OL,18,Fto return as early as 2027.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
