OL,4,C'Highly respected' council chief       
OL,5,Cexecutive dies                         
OL,6,GA chief executive who led a local      
OL,7,Gauthority in Surrey through "an        
OL,8,Gexceptionally difficult time" has      
OL,9,Gdied, the council leader has said.     
OL,11,FRichard Carr, chief executive of       
OL,12,FWoking Borough Council, took on the    
OL,13,Fleadership role after being appointed  
OL,14,Fto help the authority tackle debts of  
OL,15,F#2bn.                                  
OL,17,FFollowing his death, council leader    
OL,18,FAnn-Marie Barker said: "This is        
OL,19,Fincredibly sad news. Richard was a     
OL,20,Fhighly respected chief executive, a    
OL,21,Fdedicated public servant and a trusted 
OL,22,Fand valued colleague."            G4/4 
